{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43554","headline":"中秋夜听歌联句 · 武元衡","name":"中秋夜听歌联句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"此夕来奔月，何时去上天。\n云鬟方自照，玉腕更呈鲜。\n燕婉人间意，飘颻物外缘。\n诗裁明月扇，歌索想夫怜。\n暗染荀香久，长随楚梦偏。\n会当来彩凤，髣髴逐神仙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武元衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43554.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43554","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}